  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The proposed first-floor rear\r\nextension, by reason of its combined siting, design, full-width form would result in an incongruous, dominant\r\nand visually intrusive addition that would fail to respect the character, appearance\r\nand proportions of the host dwelling or the prevailing pattern of development\r\nwithin the surrounding area. The proposal would therefore fail to achieve a\r\nhigh standard of design and would be contrary to Policies D3 and D4 of the\r\nLondon Plan (2021) and Policies D12.1, D12.2, D12.3 and D12.4 of the Merton\r\nLocal Plan (2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The proposed part two and part single storey rear\r\nextension, by reason of its combined scale, siting and cumulative impact would create an overbearing and unduly\r\ndominant form of development along the shared boundary with No. 30 Seymour\r\nAvenue, resulting in an unacceptable sense of enclosure and harm to\r\nneighbouring residential amenity. The proposal is therefore contrary to, in particular. Policy\r\nD12.3 of the Merton Local Plan (2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
